    <bpmn:process id="W_W3053" name="W3053. Data Minimization, Retention &amp; Privacy-by-Design Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: System design or retention review
Frequency: Per design + periodic review
Volume: Enterprise systems
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Participants: DPO, IT, Data Governance, Records, Business Process Owners
Source: workflow W3053 — Data Minimization, Retention &amp; Privacy-by-Design Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3053_LaneSet4">
