      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3053_Task6" name="DPO/Data Governance apply data minimization: collect only necessary personal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DPO/Data Governance apply data minimization: collect only necessary personal data; challenge purpose vs. fields collected at each touchpoint
Responsible (R): DPO / Data Governance
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3053_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3053_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3053_Task7" name="Records/DPO define retention schedule per data category aligned to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Records/DPO define retention schedule per data category aligned to BIR/SEC/Consumer Act retention and DPA minimization; automate deletion/pseudonymization post-retention
Responsible (R): Records / DPO
Accountable (A): Records Manager
Duration: Per category</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3053_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3053_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3053_Task8" name="IT embeds privacy-by-design defaults (privacy-preserving config, access…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IT embeds privacy-by-design defaults (privacy-preserving config, access control, encryption, audit logging) into new systems per W3049
Responsible (R): IT
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3053_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3053_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
