      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Analytics, reporting, or non-production data use
Frequency: Per use case
Volume: Analytics, BI, AI/ML, test environments
Owner: Data Governance Manager
Participants: Data Governance, IT, DPO, Data Analytics
Source: workflow W3054 — De-identification, Anonymization &amp; Test Data Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3054_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3054_Lane1" name="Data Governance">
