      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: CCTV deployment or review
Frequency: Per site + annual review
Volume: 200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Participants: DPO, LP, Store Ops, Legal
Source: workflow W3055 — CCTV / Surveillance Privacy Impact &amp; Signage Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3055_LaneSet4">
