      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3055_Task6" name="DPO/LP assess CCTV coverage for necessity and proportionality (security vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DPO/LP assess CCTV coverage for necessity and proportionality (security vs. privacy); restrict cameras from private/excess areas; document lawful basis (legitimate security interest)
Responsible (R): DPO / LP
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per site + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3055_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3055_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3055_Task7" name="Store Ops/LP install compliant privacy signage at all monitored…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Ops/LP install compliant privacy signage at all monitored entrances/areas; inform visitors of surveillance and purpose
Responsible (R): Store Ops / LP
Accountable (A): Store Operations Manager
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3055_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3055_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3055_Task8" name="LP/DPO enforce retention and access controls on CCTV footage; restrict viewing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP/DPO enforce retention and access controls on CCTV footage; restrict viewing to authorized security purposes; delete per retention schedule
Responsible (R): LP / DPO
Accountable (A): LP Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3055_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3055_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
